# Aeonrift — Champion localization (en)
#
# Source locale (canonical). One entry per champion slug in content/champions/.
# Each message carries:
#   value      -> localized in-game name
#   .title     -> subtitle / epithet
#   .lore      -> one-line theme
#
# Slugs match the flat loadable specs in content/champions/*.ron exactly.
# Proper names are kept identical across locales by design (original-IP names).

## Baseline

champion-sentinel = Sentinel
    .title = The Baseline
    .lore = A plain auto-attacker with reliable, hard-hitting basics and a modest self-heal — the measure of all others.

champion-pyromancer = Pyromancer
    .title = The Embercaster
    .lore = A burst mage built around a long-range fireball that out-ranges auto-attackers and stuns before they can close.

champion-vanguard = Vanguard
    .title = The Ironbreaker
    .lore = A bruiser who dashes onto a target, strikes for heavy damage, and briefly stuns — a classic engage.

## Greek

champion-zeus = Zeus
    .title = King of Olympus
    .lore = A burst mage who calls a long-range lightning bolt that stuns, backed by a storm that damages and slows.

champion-hades = Hades
    .title = Lord of the Underworld
    .lore = A void-controller tank who drags a foe in with a stun, blankets the ground in soul-fire, and feeds on the dead.

champion-athena = Athena
    .title = Goddess of Wisdom
    .lore = A guardian support who shields herself, snares foes with a slowing owl, and commands a stunning phalanx.

champion-medusa = Medusa
    .title = The Gorgon
    .lore = A marksman whose petrifying gaze turns a target to stone, backed by a venom shot that slows.

champion-achilles = Achilles
    .title = Hero of Troy
    .lore = A near-invincible bruiser who dives onto a foe with a stunning spear and shrugs off wounds in a burst of immortal rage.

champion-artemis = Artemis
    .title = Goddess of the Hunt
    .lore = An assassin who leaps in with a crescent strike, marks fleeing prey, and looses a killing volley of moonlight.

## Norse

champion-tyr = Tyr
    .title = God of Law
    .lore = A stalwart tank who binds a single foe in place and endures with massive health and heavy self-sustain.

champion-thor = Thor
    .title = God of Thunder
    .lore = A storm bruiser who throws a stunning hammer, charges in, and calls a slowing area of thunder.

champion-odin = Odin
    .title = The Allfather
    .lore = A long-reach burst mage whose ever-hitting spear stuns from afar as his ravens carve an area and slow.

champion-loki = Loki
    .title = The Trickster
    .lore = An assassin who blinks to a mark for the roster's highest burst, then vanishes with a self-heal.

champion-freyja = Freyja
    .title = Lady of the Vanir
    .lore = An enchanter support with a large self-heal, a snaring skillshot that stuns, and a slowing falcon-cloak.

champion-ullr = Ullr
    .title = God of the Bow
    .lore = A long-range marksman who slows with frost, rains a volley over an area, and skates away on a reposition dash.

## Roman

champion-mars = Mars
    .title = God of War
    .lore = A disciplined war bruiser — a Roman general who fights with method, not raw fury.

champion-vulcan = Vulcan
    .title = The Forgefather
    .lore = A forge tank and zoner who controls space with molten ground.

champion-bellona = Bellona
    .title = Goddess of War
    .lore = A weapon-master marksman with fast, long-range auto-attacks and a pinning volley.

champion-neptune = Neptune
    .title = Lord of the Tides
    .lore = A fragile burst mage who unleashes long-range waves with heavy slows.

champion-mercury = Mercury
    .title = The Swiftbringer
    .lore = A speed assassin with blistering move speed, a dash-in burst, and a dash-out escape.

champion-janus = Janus
    .title = The Two-Faced
    .lore = A portal support offering mobility, sustain, and a gate-slam lockdown.

## Egyptian

champion-ra-radiant-dawn = Ra
    .title = Radiant Dawn
    .lore = A burst mage who deletes clustered foes with a wide sunfire nova and pokes with a piercing solar lance.

champion-anubis-warden-of-scales = Anubis
    .title = Warden of Scales
    .lore = A control tank who locks enemies down with a hard stun and crushes a whole area into a slow.

champion-horus-skyfall-talon = Horus
    .title = Skyfall Talon
    .lore = A bruiser who dives with a stunning falcon dash and grinds foes down with heavy, slowing strikes.

champion-isis-mother-of-magic = Isis
    .title = Mother of Magic
    .lore = A support built on a huge self-heal, a stunning binding spell, and a long area slow.

champion-set-lord-of-chaos = Set
    .title = Lord of Chaos
    .lore = An assassin who leaps a huge distance to detonate on a target, then heals and slips away.

champion-bastet-claws-of-the-hunt = Bastet
    .title = Claws of the Hunt
    .lore = A feline marksman whose fast basics tear through foes, kiting with a slowing claw and a nine-lives recovery.

## Ember

champion-toran = Toran
    .title = The Slagwarden
    .lore = A frontline tank who anchors fights with a heavy stun and cools himself with a forge-fed heal.

champion-vashka = Vashka
    .title = Cindermaw
    .lore = A diving bruiser who gap-closes with a burning charge and trades with sticky slows and self-sustain.

champion-ysmera = Ysmera
    .title = The Pyre-Oracle
    .lore = A fragile burst mage whose area detonations and long-range lance erase squishies in a single rotation.

champion-kaeza = Kaeza
    .title = The Emberlock
    .lore = A ranged marksman with sustained damage, a piercing bolt, and a repositioning hop.

champion-nerreth = Nerreth
    .title = The Ashstalker
    .lore = A burst assassin who blinks onto a target, dumps a stun-and-burst combo, and disengages.

## Tide

champion-brackmoor = Brackmoor
    .title = The Tidewarden
    .lore = A frontline tank with a hard freeze, self-sustain, and a slowing shockwave to peel for allies.

champion-nyxralla = Nyxralla
    .title = The Deepcaller
    .lore = A fragile, long-range burst mage who detonates targets with a high-ratio lance and a slowing bloom.

champion-cyranth = Cyranth
    .title = The Reefstalker
    .lore = A marksman with high sustained damage, a hard-hitting skillshot, and a single-target slow to kite.

champion-veyl = Veyl
    .title = The Undertow
    .lore = An assassin with a gap-closing dash burst and a lockdown execute — squishy but mobile.

champion-lumisel = Lumisel
    .title = The Tidesinger
    .lore = An enchanter support with two heals of different weights and a slowing, chip-damage zone for peel.

## Verdant

champion-mosscloak = Mosscloak
    .title = The Grovewarden
    .lore = A frontline tank who soaks damage, roots a single threat, and regrows his own bark.

champion-gorehoof = Gorehoof
    .title = The Bloodroot
    .lore = A diving bruiser who staggers on impact, trades blows, and drinks from bloodroot to stay in the fight.

champion-sporeveil = Sporeveil
    .title = The Rotbloom
    .lore = A fragile burst mage who detonates a spore bloom, smothers a zone in pollen, and snipes stragglers.

champion-thornquill = Thornquill
    .title = The Bramblewatch
    .lore = A marksman who rains scaling barbs, cripples with a piercing quill, and springs away to keep distance.

champion-petalsong = Petalsong
    .title = The Bloomsinger
    .lore = A disruptor support who locks down a key target, smothers a group with clinging vines, and sings her wounds shut.

## Umbral

champion-dregmaw = Dregmaw
    .title = The Duskbulwark
    .lore = A frontline tank fused to eclipse-iron who soaks punishment, chains a threat with an umbral grip, and mends in shadow.

champion-korrathil = Korrathil
    .title = The Voidgorger
    .lore = A diving bruiser that crashes onto prey, clamps them in place, and feeds until its own wounds close.

champion-xelphine = Xelphine
    .title = The Eclipse Seer
    .lore = A fragile burst mage who blooms shadow at her feet, lances distant prey, and calls a total nightfall.

champion-quorvane = Quorvane
    .title = Nightglass Hunter
    .lore = A patient marksman who fires void-glass shards from the edge of sight and pins fleeing prey with a piercing round.

champion-zeryth = Zeryth
    .title = The Umbral Fang
    .lore = A burst assassin of living shadow who folds the distance to a mark, pins them mid-scream, and finishes in darkness.
